                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">The modern climate of the study area is temperate, with relatively mild winters and</span>                            <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
