                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">The landscape consists of U-shaped valleys with ﬂat, angled, polished bedrock surfaces</span>                         <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>                                                                                                                 <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">that are favourable for the formation of sliding planes. Other signatures of the strong linear,</span>                <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
