                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">produced by co-author D. Rüther. The detailed ﬁeld map by Rüther was initially produced</span>                        <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
