                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">three sets—namely, in Set 1, landslides were not visible in the SAR-RGB image; in Set 2,</span>                       <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
