                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">During veriﬁcation, minor differences were found between the two inventories due to the</span>                        <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
