                        "text/plain": [
                            "\u001b[32m╭─\u001b[0m\u001b[32m──────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[32m ✅ Tool Execution Completed (#2) \u001b[0m\u001b[32m───────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[32m─╮\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[1;32mTool Completed\u001b[0m                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37mTool: \u001b[0m\u001b[1;32msearch_a_pdfs_content\u001b[0m                                                                                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[37mOutput: \u001b[0m\u001b[32mRelevant Content:\u001b[0m                                                                                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mPage 2:\u001b[0m                                                                                                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mRemote Sens. 2022, 14, 2301\u001b[0m                                                                                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m2 of 25\u001b[0m                                                                                                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m1. Introduction\u001b[0m                                                                                                \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mThe frequency and intensity of severe precipitation events are expected to continue\u001b[0m                            \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mincreasing as a result of climate change [1,2]. In turn, precipitation-triggered disasters,\u001b[0m                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mincluding landslides and ﬂoods, are also becoming more frequent [3]. Landslide early\u001b[0m                           \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mwarning systems (LEWSs) aim to reduce loss of life and damage, by giving people advanced\u001b[0m                       \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mwarning so that emergency responders may prepare resources and warn the public to\u001b[0m                              \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mavoid high-risk areas [4]. Existing LEWSs rely on knowledge of past events in order to\u001b[0m                         \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mimprove the understanding of landslide triggering processes, develop warning thresholds\u001b[0m                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mand prediction models, and ﬁnally verify warnings issued and evaluate performance [5].\u001b[0m                         \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mLandslide inventory data are also needed to produce landslide susceptibility and hazard\u001b[0m                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
