                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">over temporarily reduced NDVI signals from agricultural activity. In comparison, for</span>                           <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
