                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mskredregistering.no, accessed on 18 January 2022, hence referred to as registered events) in the\u001b[0m               \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mstudy area, and several instances of rock falls. Registered events are dated from 1625 to 2019.\u001b[0m                \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mThe majority of the registered events in the NLDB are derived from observations along the\u001b[0m                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mroad network.\u001b[0m                                                                                                  \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mThe modern climate of the study area is temperate, with relatively mild winters and\u001b[0m                            \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mwet summers due to the proximity to the coast. Glaciers are still active in the region, with\u001b[0m                   \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mJostedalsbreen National Park, located 30 km east of the study area. Vegetation in the study\u001b[0m                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32marea ranges from sparse moss and shrubs or light birch forest at high elevations, to spruce\u001b[0m                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mPage 9:\u001b[0m                                                                                                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mRemote Sens. 2022, 14, 2301\u001b[0m                                                                                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m9 of 25\u001b[0m                                                                                                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mforest and agricultural ﬁelds lower in the valleys. Roads and built areas are mainly located\u001b[0m                   \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32min the ﬂatter main valleys.\u001b[0m                                                                                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m3. Data Used\u001b[0m                                                                                                   \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mThe main input data were satellite images from Sentinel-1 and -2 missions of the\u001b[0m                               \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mEuropean Space Agency (ESA), acquired either by downloading from Copernicus Open\u001b[0m                               \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mAccess Hub (COAH, https://scihub.copernicus.eu/dhus/#/home, accessed 10 August\u001b[0m                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m2019) or used directly within the GEE code editor (https://code.earthengine.google.com/,\u001b[0m                       \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32maccessed 10 August 2019). Sentinel-1 SAR data are dual-polarised (VV and VH), with\u001b[0m                             \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mC-band (5.405 GHz), and available in Level 1 single-look complex (SLC) or ground-range-\u001b[0m                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mdetected (GRD) scenes. We used data acquired in interferometric wide (IW) acquisition\u001b[0m                          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mmode. Terrain corrections were applied using a 10 m resolution digital terrain model\u001b[0m                           \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m(DTM), downloaded from Høydedata, as shown in Table 1. For Sentinel-2, we used the\u001b[0m                             \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mLevel 2A product, bottom of atmosphere (BOA) reﬂectance images, pre-processed from\u001b[0m                             \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mLevel 1C products using sen2cor. In addition, historic landslide data from the NLDB and\u001b[0m                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mroad data were used in the analysis of spatial bias, with source details shown in Table 1.\u001b[0m                     \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
