                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">Using GEE, Sentinel-1 GRD scenes were used. These are available as pre-processed im-</span>                           <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
