                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mof the true spatial distribution of landslides, as can be seen in Figure 1. Additionally,\u001b[0m                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
