                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mgated clusters of pixels, were drawn manually in SNAP. In analysing spatial bias, a compar-\u001b[0m                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mison was made of the minimum distance between landslides and roads, between the S2-BT\u001b[0m                          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mlandslide inventory, and the landslides reported in the national database, RegObs. The\u001b[0m                         \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mVbase roads dataset was used. The minimum distance was estimated using the Near (anal-\u001b[0m                         \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mysis toolbox) tool in ArcMap, using the reported landslide points from RegObs, and points\u001b[0m                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mysis toolbox) tool in ArcMap, using the reported landslide points from RegObs, and points\u001b[0m                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mgenerated from the centre of the mapped landslide polygons using the Feature-to-Point\u001b[0m                          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
