                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m(data management toolbox) tool.\u001b[0m                                                                                \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m4.2.2. Preliminary Field Mapping and Veriﬁcation\u001b[0m                                                               \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mVeriﬁcation of the preliminary map was conducted through ﬁeld visits (in August\u001b[0m                                \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mand October 2019) and a helicopter ﬂight (October 2019). The preliminary map was then\u001b[0m                          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mupdated to include several small landslide scarps observed during the helicopter ﬂight,\u001b[0m                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mwhich were visible in the image but had not been included in the preliminary mapping\u001b[0m                           \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mdue to uncertainty. Finally, a comparison was made with a detailed map of the landslides\u001b[0m                       \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mproduced by co-author D. Rüther. The detailed ﬁeld map by Rüther was initially produced\u001b[0m                        \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mby visual comparison of pre- and post-event Sentinel-2 images, then updated based on\u001b[0m                           \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mextensive ﬁeld investigations (in August and September 2019, and May, June, and August\u001b[0m                         \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m2020), along with drone orthophotos. A selection of photos from this ﬁeldwork is shown in\u001b[0m                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mFigure 4, and a detailed report of ﬁeld observations is also available [36]. This inventory\u001b[0m                    \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mshows the landslides divided into release, transport, and deposition zones and has a much\u001b[0m                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
