                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">The optical images were not all cloud-covered in this period;</span>                                                  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
