                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mcomposite images were created by taking the maximum NDVI value for each pixel, within\u001b[0m                          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mthe image collection, using the quality mosaic function. Finally, a difference image (dNDVI)\u001b[0m                   \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mwas produced by subtracting the pre-event composite from the post-event composite.\u001b[0m                             \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
