                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mPre- and post-event scenes were downloaded from COAH. The selected scenes were\u001b[0m                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
