                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m4.1.3. Sentinel-1 Bi-Temporal (S1-BT)\u001b[0m                                                                          \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mPre- and post-event scenes were downloaded from COAH. The selected scenes were\u001b[0m                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32macquired in interferometric wide (IW) acquisition mode, with Level 1 single-look complex\u001b[0m                       \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32m(SLC) format, dual polarisation (VV and VH), and from ascending paths. The pre-event\u001b[0m                           \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
