                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">the 120 landslides, 43% were also detectable in the multi-temporal SAR image composite in VV</span>                   <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>                                                                                                                 <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
