                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">indicate that manual or automated landslide detection could be signiﬁcantly improved with multi-</span>               <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>                                                                                                                 <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
