                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mcomposites with freely available Sentinel-1 and -2 satellite images, in order to improve landslide\u001b[0m             \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m                                                                                                                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mvisibility and facilitate landslide detection. First, multispectral Sentinel-2 images were used to map\u001b[0m         \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
