                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">4.2.4. Landslide Visibility in VV and VH Polarisations and Effect of Local Incidence Angle</span>                     <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
