                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">To analyse the difference in landslide visibility in VV and VH polarisations, ﬁrst, a</span>                          <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
