                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">{\"methods\": [{\"name\": \"Manual digitisation of landslides from Sentinel-2 Bi-Temporal (S2-BT) dNDVI composite </span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">in SNAP\", \"method_type\": \"MANUAL\", \"summary\": \"Preliminary landslide mapping was conducted using the </span>          <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">conventional S2-BT approach. Pre- and post-event Level 2A Sentinel-2 tiles were processed in SNAP 7.0 </span>         <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">software (cropped, collocated, and band-math used to calculate dNDVI = (B8R\\u2212B4R)/(B8R+B4R) \\u2212 </span>        <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">(B8S\\u2212B4S)/(B8S+B4S)). Polygons delimiting assumed landslides, typically represented by dark elongated </span>    <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">clusters of pixels, were then drawn manually in SNAP. This preliminary mapping was completed within a week of</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">the landslide occurrences and took approximately three hours; it was later verified and updated through field</span>  <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
                            "<span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>  <span style=\"color: #00ff00; text-decoration-color: #00ff00\">visits, a helicopter flight, and comparison with a detailed field map.\", \"code_status\": \"N/A\", \"code_link\": </span>   <span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration-color: #008000\">│</span>\n",
