                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[92m\"https://github.com/erin-ntnu/Change-detection-images-GEE\", \"reused_citation\": null}, {\"name\": \"Detailed \u001b[0m      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
