                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[92m\"method_type\": \"MANUAL\", \"summary\": \"A detailed landslide map was produced by co-author D. R\\u00fcther, \u001b[0m       \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[92minitially through visual comparison of pre- and post-event Sentinel-2 images, then refined through extensive \u001b[0m  \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
                            "\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m  \u001b[92mfield investigations (August/September 2019, May/June/August 2020) and drone orthophotos. This inventory \u001b[0m      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\n",
